WideWorldImporters sample database
==================================

The files in this directory (`ddl/*.sql`, `data/*.csv`) are a PostgreSQL port
of Microsoft's WideWorldImporters sample OLTP database, obtained from
https://github.com/microsoft/sql-server-samples and used under the MIT License.
The schema was translated to PostgreSQL syntax; the sample data is unmodified.

This notice covers every file in this directory, including the CSV data files,
which carry no individual headers.

The upstream notice is reproduced verbatim below.

